176:P-Please! Take us there...!
179:This is the building where I was imprisoned...
183:Maybe we'll be able to find some other clues here.
185:Saber?
187:...S-Someone? Who could it be, nyaa?
188:...Given the timing, maybe it's one of the kidnappers.
